#   description     : "1.0809 - MSWRK - Ensure User Account Control: Run all administrators in Admin Approval Mode is set to Enabled"
#   info            : "This policy setting controls the behavior of all User Account Control (UAC) policy settings for the computer."
#   solution        : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Enabled :"
